    "description": "Follows the Windows light/dark app setting and switches IDA's theme at runtime, without restarting IDA. Ships a re-implementation of IDA's theme.css preprocessor (@importtheme / @def / @palette / @ifdef / @lighten / @darken) so QSS and palette are swapped in place.",
